<title>USA: PepsiCo's Tricon names financial chief.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo's Tricon names financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A former Burger King chief executive was named chief financial officer of Tricon Global Restaurants Inc, the restaurant operation to be spun off by PepsiCo Inc later this year.</p>
<p>Robert Lowes will serve as chief financial officer of the company, composed of PepsiCo's KFC, Pizza Hut and Taco Bell restaurant chains, Tricon said in a news release on Thursday.</p>
<p>Burger King is a subsidiary of Grand Metropolitan Plc.</p>
